","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the middle sat at 76% of normal in both July to August and August to September, and in 2026 January to February came in at 46%. Grid 22985 had its driest year in 1999 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
